      "description": "Compact state labels with paired pale and dark semantic colors.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><span class=\"ds-chip\">Ready</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-green\">Complete</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-amber\">Delayed</span><span class=\"ds-chip ds-red\">Failed</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f1f4f8;color:#53657d;font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:750;white-space:nowrap}.ds-green{background:#e9f5ed;color:#256143}.ds-amber{background:#fff3db;color:#815616}.ds-red{background:#fbedef;color:#9f3043}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Research panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "White bounded surfaces hold readable research and provenance.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>Research proposal</h2><p>Evidence and risk, reviewed together.</p></div><div class=\"ds-panel-note\">A completed run will produce an explained proposal.</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#172945);border:1px solid var(--line,#e1e7f0);border-radius:var(--radius,14px);overflow:hidden;max-width:440px}.ds-panel-heading{padding:21px 22px 13px}.ds-panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-panel-heading p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted,#596b83)}.ds-panel-note{display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:10px;color:#566d86;line-height:1.65;background:#f7f9fc;padding:14px 18px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspectable pipeline node",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "pipeline-node",
      "description": "A stateful agent step with role, framework and current status.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-node\"><span class=\"ds-node-icon\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ds-node-name\"><strong>Market analyst</strong><small>Google ADK</small></span><span class=\"ds-node-state\">Ready</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-node{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;position:relative;background:#f8faff;border:1px solid var(--line,#e1e7f0);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;text-align:left;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;color:var(--ink,#172945);max-width:260px;min-height:117px;transition:background .25s,border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s}.ds-node:hover{border-color:#7c99cf;background:#eff4ff}.ds-node:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8daae4;outline-offset:3px}.ds-node-icon{color:#5d7dae;display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:7px;background:#e9effb;flex:none}.ds-node-name{flex:1;align-self:center}.ds-node-name strong{font-size:12px;display:block}.ds-node-name small{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#596b83);display:block;margin-top:5px}.ds-node-state{width:100%;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#596b83)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-node{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "evidence-tab",
      "description": "Specialist report navigation with availability metadata.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Specialist reports\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Market <span>Available</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">News <span>Pending</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;overflow:auto;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e1e7f0);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e1e7f0);padding:0 12px}.ds-tab{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#596b83);font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:16px 12px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-tab[aria-selected=true]{border-bottom-color:var(--blue,#294e96);color:var(--blue,#294e96);background:#f7f9fe}.ds-tab span{font-size:9px;background:#eef2f8;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 5px}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#89aaf0);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Debate contribution",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "debate-turn",
      "description": "A readable argument with a role cue and time, before raw output.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-turn\"><div class=\"ds-turn-heading\"><span class=\"ds-speaker\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4\"/></svg></span><strong>Bull researcher</strong><time>10:42</time></div><div class=\"ds-argument\"><p>Validated contributions appear here after specialist evidence arrives.</p><button class=\"ds-turn-action\">Structured output</button></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-turn{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#172945);padding:23px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e1e7f0);max-width:650px}.ds-turn-heading{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.ds-turn-heading strong{font-size:13px}.ds-turn-heading time{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#596b83)}.ds-speaker{display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;background:#eaf4ef;color:var(--positive,#167357);border-radius:8px}.ds-argument{margin-left:40px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;max-width:78ch}.ds-turn-action{font-family:'Manrope Variable',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;background:transparent;color:var(--blue,#294e96);font-size:11px;font-weight:750;padding:6px 0;border:0;min-height:36px}.ds-turn-action:hover{color:#132f64}.ds-turn-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#89aaf0);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-argument{margin-left:0}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Evidence Atlas",
    "overview": "Evidence Atlas pairs a deep-blue navigation shell with cool light work areas and dark financial ink. Manrope keeps controls, evidence and tabular figures in one clear typographic voice. Emerald marks positive movement and completed evidence; amber and red expose warnings and failures.\n\nThe system is professional, compact and inspectable. Bordered surfaces organize dense research without turning every block into a floating card. Authored SVG diagrams and animated evidence connections explain actual workflow events; readable reports and debate arguments carry the substance.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Deep-blue shell around cool light research surfaces.",
      "Manrope typography with tabular financial numerals.",
      "Bounded semantic color and explicit status labels.",
      "Authored SVG evidence geometry and event-driven handoffs.",
      "Readable evidence first, structured details on demand."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Color Rule",
        "body": "Semantic color follows evidence or execution state and is accompanied by a label or icon.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bounded Surface Rule",
        "body": "Research panels establish hierarchy with borders and tonal layering; lift is reserved for overlays or active work.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the shared ink, muted, surface, canvas and blue primitives for new surfaces.",
      "**Do** pair status color with a readable label or icon.",
      "**Do** keep source dates, provider identity, missing data and draft validation status visible.",
      "**Do** preserve the selected symbol and exchange on narrow screens.",
      "**Do** make reduced-motion state changes immediate and keep keyboard focus visible."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** animate progress independently of actual execution events.",
      "**Don't** imply a generated report timestamp is the source publication time.",
      "**Don't** use positive green or warning amber as decorative backgrounds for unrelated actions.",
      "**Don't** replace authored evidence geometry with generic stock imagery.",
      "**Don't** hide primary research content behind raw structured output."
    ]
  }
}
